      "mergeID": "63fd03b6d020ce01632e5264",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The queues for the string downloader and image downloader are not cleared when they leave the instance.\n\nIf you leave an instance with a large number of downloaders before the queue is empty, the download will continue at the next instance. This will also affect downloads at the next instance.\n\nPlease clear the queue when leaving an instance.",
